{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Anything you can get from what's left of this animal? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^Oh my, such agony illuminating from the body of that poor creature ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^What can you tell me?","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^We'll catch them","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Is there anything you can tell me by looking at this evidence ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"WhatCanYouTellMe"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ We will catch whatever psycho did this. ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"WhatCanYouTellMe"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",{"#f":5}]}],"done",{"WhatCanYouTellMe":[["^Um, Its hard to tell. I would need to study it closer.","\n","^Give Sennah the evidence to study? (this will block the option for others) ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","ev","str","^Yes","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^No","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Yes ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Yes"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ No ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Yes":[["^the animals dont particularly seem paranormal. But the way that they are layed out and missing parts resemble that of rituals I have read about before. ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^What kind","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Paranormal?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ What kind of rituals ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layo